  "description": "Create magical celebrations with this dreamy pastel pink clipart collection!\nThis enchanting digital bundle features over 40 beautifully illustrated watercolor graphics in soft pastel pink tones. Perfect for birthday invitations, baby showers, princess parties, feminine branding, and any celebration needing a touch of elegance and whimsy.\nWhat’s Included:\n🎈 Party Balloons – Gorgeous watercolor balloon clusters, single balloons with ribbons, and floating balloon arrangements in blush pink and lavender tones\n🎂 Birthday Cakes – Adorable tiered birthday cakes with candles, frosting details, and decorative elements\n🌸 Floral Arrangements – Delicate pink flower bouquets, rose clusters, and botanical accents in soft watercolor style\n👠 Glamorous Accessories – Sparkly pink high heels with glitter effects and elegant styling\n🎀 Decorative Bows – Beautiful satin ribbon bows in soft pink shades, perfect for gift wrapping designs\n👑 Princess Tiaras – Ornate crowns with pearls and jewel details for royal-themed celebrations\n🎁 Gift Boxes – Wrapped presents with bows and decorative patterns in coordinating pink tones\n🧁 Sweet Treats – Pink unicorn cupcakes with pastel frosting and magical details\n💎 Disco Balls – Glittery mirror ball ornaments in pink and lavender hues\n🩰 Ballet Slippers & Dresses – Graceful pink tutus and pointe shoes for dance-themed projects\nPerfect For:\nBirthday party invitations and decorations\nBaby shower graphics and announcements\nPrincess party themes\nFeminine branding and logos\nScrapbooking and journaling\nSocial media posts and stories\nGreeting cards and gift tags\nPlanner stickers and inserts\nWebsite and blog headers\nPrint-on-demand products\nFile Details:\nHigh-resolution PNG files with transparent backgrounds\nWatercolor illustration style\nPrint and web ready\nInstant digital download\nCommercial use friendly\nBring your creative visions to life with these soft, sophisticated pastel graphics!",
